+// Skinny bf16 GEMM for M up to 16: C[M,N] = A[M,K] @ W[N,K]^T with v_dot2_f32_bf16, a wave an
+// output column. On gfx1151 this streams the weight faster than the WMMA form below at decode
+// heights, where the weight read is the whole cost. K divisible by SK with (K/SK) a multiple of
