+// ---- Block-scaled FP8, as checkpoints ship it -------------------------------------------------
+//
+// Reads the weight as safetensors stores it: `<linear>.weight` F8_E4M3 row-major [N][K] and
+// `<linear>.weight_scale_inv` BF16 on a [ceil(N/128)][ceil(K/128)] grid (DeepSeek-style,
